Scope of this licence

It covers the code and documentation in this repository, which are the author's
own work. It does not extend to third-party dependencies, each of which carries
its own licence — the Laravel framework and the packages under `vendor/` and
`node_modules/` are the largest of them.

The coding-challenge brief and the job description this project was written
against are not in this repository and are not licensed here. Both are excluded
by `.gitignore` (`/the-skills-network`): the job description carries a named
employee's work email address and a salary figure, and the brief is The Skills
Network's material rather than the author's.
